    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETUP\n\nConfigure the following in **n8n Settings > Environment Variables**:\n\n- `APOLLO_API_KEY` — Apollo.io API key\n- `OPENAI_API_KEY` — OpenAI API key\n- `INSTANTLY_API_KEY` — Instantly.ai API key\n- `INSTANTLY_CAMPAIGN_ID` — Target campaign ID\n- `PIPELINE_LOG_SHEET_ID` — Google Sheets spreadsheet ID\n\nAlso connect your **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential before activating.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-120, 640]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STAGE 1: Lead Discovery\n\nApollo.io People Search fetches leads matching your target persona. Edit the body parameters to adjust title filters, company size, and location.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-stage1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STAGE 2: AI Research + Personalization\n\nEach lead is individually researched via GPT-4o-mini. Company context is used to write a personalized email with subject line variants.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-stage2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1440, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STAGE 3: Email Delivery\n\nPersonalized leads are enrolled in your Instantly.ai campaign with custom variables injected for subject and body. All leads are logged to Google Sheets.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-stage3",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2400, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ERROR HANDLING\n\nAny node failure triggers the Error Handler. Error details (node name, message, stack trace) are appended to the **Errors** tab in your Google Sheet for visibility.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "sticky-errors",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Errors",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2160, 520]
    }
